  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p>"
